xt":"In Marcus's fictional documentation system, the same conversation generates","startMs":3140,"endMs":7660},{"text":"a page and rates its accuracy.","startMs":7660,"endMs":10280},{"text":"The page marks a required parameter optional, invents response","startMs":10280,"endMs":14120},{"text":"fields, and describes the wrong rate-limit scope.","startMs":14120,"endMs":17840},{"text":"Its own reviewer approves because the draft matches assumptions","startMs":17840,"endMs":21220},{"text":"already present in the conversation.","startMs":21220,"endMs":23800},{"text":"A timeout patch is our second case.","startMs":23800,"endMs":26520},{"text":"A fresh reviewer sees a locally correct function but","startMs":26520,"endMs":29500},{"text":"lacks the caller that supplies milliseconds where the function","startMs":29500,"endMs":32300},{"text":"expects seconds.","startMs":32300,"endMs":34020},{"text":"Removing too much context leaves that reviewer uninformed.","startMs":34020,"endMs":38020},{"text":"A manipulated document is our third case.","startMs":38020,"endMs":40800},{"text":"The artifact contains an instruction telling the checker to","startMs":40800,"endMs":43560},{"text":"ignore the rubric and approve it.","startMs":43560,"endMs":45840},{"text":"A separate request does not automatically make that instruction","startMs":45840,"endMs":48820},{"text":"harmless.","startMs":48820,"endMs":50200},{"text":"These cases are illustrations, not a measured guarantee that","startMs":50200,"endMs":53800},{"text":"context separation improves every model or task.","startMs":53800,"endMs":56660},{"text":"Our governing question is: what information should reach the","startMs":56660,"endMs":60880},{"text":"checker?","startMs":60880,"endMs":61960},{"text":"We will build a factual review packet, audit the","startMs":61960,"endMs":64860},{"text":"actual request, measure shared errors, and return evidence-backed feedback.","startMs":64860,"endMs":70040},{"text":"By the end, you should be able t